{"4190200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duckscape", "steam_appid": 4190200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Walk along your keyboard to spell out a swirly story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Duckscape you will need to contort your fingers to move around your keyboard in this oddly controlled game. Hold one key, hold another, release the last key, and so on.<br>Avoid enemies and collect peas to spell out words. Some of the things you type out may become real, and some of the things you type may unlock new ways to play.<br>Contains various levels, game modes and modifiers, and an endless mode.<br><br>The story mode spells out a quaint tale of friendship in the modern age.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Walk along your keyboard to spell out a swirly story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In Duckscape you will need to contort your fingers to move around your keyboard in this oddly controlled game. Hold one key, hold another, release the last key, and so on.<br>Avoid enemies and collect peas to spell out words. Some of the things you type out may become real, and some of the things you type may unlock new ways to play.<br>Contains various levels, game modes and modifiers, and an endless mode.<br><br>The story mode spells out a quaint tale of friendship in the modern age.</p>", "short_description": "Walk along your keyboard to spell out a swirly story. In Duckscape you will need to contort your fingers to move around your keyboard in this oddly controlled game. Unlock levels, game modes and modifiers, and an endless mode. Spell out a quaint tale of friendship in the modern age.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared